  "ruleText": "Plc 807 (formerly He-P 6003)\n\nThe prior filings affecting the rules in the former Chapter He-P 6000 include the following documents:\n\n#5199, eff 8-7-91; EXPIRED 8-7-97\n\n#6567, INTERIM, eff 8-22-97, EXPIRED 12-20-97\n\n#6728, eff 4-1-98\n\n#7119, eff 10-16-99\n\n#7894, eff 5-21-03\n\n#8593, eff 3-28-06\n\n#10453, eff 10-31-13",
